{
  "id": "chilling-reign-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Chilling Reign Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Sold by shops in the Prerelease Program from 5 June 2021 in place of prerelease tournaments, ahead of the expansion's release on 18 June. Each box held four Chilling Reign booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Chilling Reign logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Cinderace, Inteleon and Gardevoir, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and Sword & Shield's non-holo Professor's Research, first found in that expansion's box. Staff copies of the promos were never handed out officially, but a Staff Cinderace was apparently packed by accident in a very small number of boxes.",
    "sources": [
      {
